<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!-- Custom units borrow the models of base units (same table Firaxis uses for the Founder-edition
     scout and palace). From = our type, To = the type whose art is shown. Remaps are keyed by ID and
     players can toggle each one in Options. Choices (Sep 2026): Cataphract = Mongol Keshig (the
     Scythia Workshop civ's amazon horse archer is itself a Keshig remap), Dromon = Treasure Fleet
     hull (a civilian model: if attack animations turn out missing, fall back to UNIT_GALLEON).
     Hagia Sophia is not remapped: it has its own art entry in the ByzantiumArt package
     (dlc/ByzantiumArt, built with Civ Art Tools from the Blue Mosque's attachment set). -->
<Database>
